<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKProjects#Internal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Internal information is defined as information that is only intended for internal distribution within an organisation. In the majority of instances there would be no significant impact on the organisation, its staff, clients or patients if this type of information was mishandled or accidentally released."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKProjects#Internal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Internal"@en .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKProjects#Personal
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKProjects#Personal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
