<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKProjects#Personal> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Lucy McKenna" .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKProjects#Personal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Restricted information that contains personal data. Personal data, as defined by the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), is any data that relates to a person or that could be used to identify a person."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKProjects#Personal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Personal"@en .
