<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKProjects#Public> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Lucy McKenna" .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKProjects#Public> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Public information is defined as information that is available to the general public and is intended for distribution outside an organisation. There would be no impact on the organisation, its staff, clients or patients if this type of information was mishandled or accidentally released."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKProjects#Public> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Public"@en .
